# CryptoTrace ML sidecar — environment (all optional).
# Secrets are read from the environment ONLY; never commit real values.

# Path to the committed XGBoost model. Defaults to ./models/xgb_model.json.
# MODEL_PATH=./models/xgb_model.json

# ── Optional: Neo4j GDS backend for the 4 GDS features ───────────────────────
# When set (URI + PASSWORD), the sidecar projects each trace and streams real
# gds.pageRank / betweenness / louvain / localClusteringCoefficient, falling back
# to NetworkX on any error. Requires a Neo4j server with the GDS plugin.
# NEO4J_URI=bolt://localhost:7687
# NEO4J_USER=neo4j
# NEO4J_PASSWORD=
